   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "This table contains data for the first five schools (alphabetically) that fielded an NCAA Division I men’s basketball team in the 2018–2019 season. It shows the total number of points each team scored (PF) and the total number of points their opponents scored against them (PA). Create a scatter plot without technology of PA vs. PF.\n<table class=\"unnumbered\"><caption>(source: www.sports-reference.com)</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>School</th>\n<th>PF</th>\n<th>PA</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Abilene Christian</td>\n<td>2502</td>\n<td>2161</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Air Force</td>\n<td>2179</td>\n<td>2294</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Akron</td>\n<td>2271</td>\n<td>2107</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alabama A&amp;M</td>\n<td>1938</td>\n<td>2285</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Alabama-Birmingham</td>\n<td>2470</td>\n<td>2370</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
